sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Part as Any part that logs
    participant Handler as Log handler
    participant Mask as Mask
    participant Output as Standard error

    Part->>+Handler: a record, its data only in the payload attribute
    Note over Handler: adds the request id of the call
    Note over Handler: LOG_PAYLOAD policy: keep the payload of this record, or drop it
    Handler->>+Mask: the payload
    Note over Mask: marked fields masked or omitted, the rest kept
    Mask-->>-Handler: the masked payload, and what it could not parse
    Note over Handler: unreadable data is never written raw: a WARN instead
    Handler->>+Output: one JSON line
    Output-->>-Handler: written
    Handler-->>-Part: done
